 "_doc": "Ethernet pin families and the verified SoC pin tables. A pin is Ethernet only when the workbook's SELECTED function says so; the 'interfaces' capability list is never used. Function names/mux values below were read from the Linux pinctrl driver of the named SoC; a SoC without an entry gets the workbook's function text and a NEEDS REVIEW.",
